@startuml COM2_Enterprise_Classes

title COM2 — Enterprise Viewpoint — Service Structure

left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Interaction Submitter" as Submitter <<Enterprise Role>>

class "COM2 Service" as Service <<Service>>

class "Enterprise Service Contract" as Contract <<Service Contract>>

class "G-COM2-01\nControlled Interaction Admission" as G1 <<Service Guarantee>>

class "G-COM2-02\nExplicit Admission Outcome" as G2 <<Service Guarantee>>

class "G-COM2-03\nInteraction Identity Preservation" as G3 <<Service Guarantee>>

class "G-COM2-04\nOptional Interaction Information" as G4 <<Service Guarantee>>

Submitter --> Service : uses

Contract --> Service : governs

Contract --> G1 : defines
Contract --> G2 : defines
Contract --> G3 : defines
Contract --> G4 : defines

G1 ..> Service : constrains
G2 ..> Service : constrains
G3 ..> Service : constrains
G4 ..> Service : constrains

note bottom of Service
Enterprise use:
UC-COM2-01
Submit Interaction for Admission
end note

@enduml
